{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>《Days until my due date?》是一款陪伴準媽媽走過整個孕期的工具，由預產期計算與倒數開始，延伸至寶寶名字靈感、每週孕期狀態與私人日記，適合剛確認懷孕或已進入最後幾週的孕婦使用。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n\n\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-21.webp\"/></figure>\n\n\n<h2>孕期倒數與貼心小工具</h2>\n\n\n<p>開啟程式即見簡潔的預產期計算器與倒數計時，清楚掌握剩餘日子。程式另設寶寶名字生成器、每週孕期狀態與私人日記，可記下心情、夢境與飲食偏好，並預測寶寶星座。內置智能計算器協助估算受孕日期、追蹤重要里程碑與規劃大學儲蓄，另附輕鬆小遊戲讓思緒休息。</p>\n\n\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-655-scaled.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-656-scaled.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-657-scaled.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-658-scaled.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-659-scaled.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-660-scaled.jpg\"/></figure></figure>\n\n\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Days until my due date?</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/days-until-my-due-date/id725271047?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:46.316468+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":311,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T10:28:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.635100+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.635100+00:00","content_hash":"5f4b0a26481e3ed37908ad84a1491f9e4567d6da8c6d154ef4ce5e5247156163","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}